### Create Two Sum Problem
POST http://localhost:8080/api/problems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Two Sum",
  "description": "Given an array of integers `nums` and an integer `target`, return indices of the two numbers such that they add up to `target`.\n\nYou may assume that each input would have exactly one solution, and you may not use the same element twice.\n\nYou can return the answer in any order."
}

### Add Test Case 1 (Example: replace UUID with the actual problem ID)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/problems/097ef98b-499b-4008-afb9-eeea3788b103/testcase/new
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "[2, 7, 11, 15]\n9",
  "expectedOutput": "[0, 1]"
}

