### Fetch All submissions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/submissions/f57e6417-14b9-4798-b57a-0d28de1e26ea

### Submit Code to Problem
POST http://localhost:8080/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "097ef98b-499b-4008-afb9-eeea3788b102",
  "problemId": "097ef98b-499b-4008-afb9-eeea3788b103",
  "language": "python",
  "sourceCode": "import sys\nimport json\n\ndef twoSum(nums, target):\n    numMap = {}\n    for i, num in enumerate(nums):\n        complement = target - num\n        if complement in numMap:\n            return [numMap[complement], i]\n        numMap[num] = i\n    return []\n\nlines = sys.stdin.read().strip().splitlines()\nnums = json.loads(lines[0])\ntarget = int(lines[1])\nprint(json.dumps(twoSum(nums, target)))"
}
